# NOTICE

This package is a maintained fork of the OpenCode Zen Free plugin from
[magpie-community/plugins](https://github.com/magpie-community/plugins), which
is MIT licensed. Upstream's notice, `Copyright (c) 2026 xiaozhou26`, is kept in
[LICENSE](./LICENSE) alongside this fork's own — the second copyright line
there, `Copyright (c) 2026 OpenCode-Zen-FreeX contributors`. The license text
itself is unmodified MIT.

The fork is maintained separately from upstream under the name
`opencode-zen-freex` (https://github.com/tkhs101/OpenCode-Zen-FreeX) because the
free tier's request fingerprint moves faster than that repository follows it:
the tool wording and User-Agent Zen accepts can be recaptured with
`bun run capture` from a clone of this repository — `capture.mjs` is a
maintenance tool and is not part of the published tarball — without waiting for a
release upstream. `MAINTAINING.md` describes that loop.

The provider id this package registers, `opencode-zen-free`, is deliberately the
same one upstream's plugin registers — a model is written
`opencode-zen-free/<model>` either way — so the two are mutually exclusive;
install one.
